---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SectionHeader from '../components/SectionHeader.astro';
---

<Base title="Teaching">
  <main class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 pt-24 pb-12 md:pt-28 md:pb-20">
    <SectionHeader
      title="Teaching"
      subtitle="I teach undergraduate and graduate courses that connect anthropological theory, quantitative methods, and long-term social-ecological change."
    />

    <p class="text-brand-charcoal leading-relaxed mb-12 max-w-3xl">
      My teaching emphasizes critical analysis, imagination, and evidence-based explanation. In undergraduate
      and graduate classrooms, students evaluate ethnographic and archaeological data, test competing
      explanations, and build the skills needed to ask and answer substantive research questions.
    </p>

    <section class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 mb-16">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-brand-charcoal mb-4">Graduate Courses</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-brand-charcoal">
          <li>Quantitative Methods</li>
          <li>Paleodemography</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-brand-charcoal mb-4">Undergraduate Courses</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-brand-charcoal">
          <li>Archaeology of Ancient Civilizations</li>
          <li>Histories and Theories of Anthropology</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/*
    <section class="mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-brand-charcoal mb-6">Mentoring</h2>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div>
          <p class="text-3xl font-semibold text-brand-terracotta">15</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-brand-stone">Graduate students mentored to degree completion</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-3xl font-semibold text-brand-terracotta">4</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-brand-stone">Summer research grants chaired (undergraduate)</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    */}

    <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-brand-terracotta pl-6 py-2 text-brand-charcoal italic leading-relaxed">
      “It is a privilege to teach courses, mentor students, and witness their success. Moving forward, I will
      continue to engage in reflexive teaching in an effort to help students develop critical thinking skills and
      build life-long learning habits.”
    </blockquote>
  </main>
</Base>
